     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/05b645b951e14778.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/1910e9d0526b85cf.jpg",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "h2",
     "text": "Error:",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "24px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "error"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/8e68ee701d4ebea0.jpg",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Some users may not be able to install our Google Workspace add-ons as some error appears during the installation of the add-on.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/2deb793bb74c46db.jpg",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "h2",
     "text": "Why this error appears?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "24px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "why-this-error-appears"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/013a6e5d76705e9c.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "This error may occur as the add-on may be blocked from their server side or the permissions required to install the add-on may be denied from their admin.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/c80cab5f2d860f83.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "h2",
     "text": "What is whitelisting apps?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "24px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "what-is-whitelisting-apps"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/00778ed7789ad2fb.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Whitelisting an add-on means admins assign permissions at the domain level, and that end users don't have to make choices on permissions for those apps. By whitelisting add-on admins can ensure apps have the permissions they need to work properly.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/971d79a8bbce61a8.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "h2",
     "text": "How to setup whitelisting?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "24px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "how-to-setup-whitelisting"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/a9b61a5dc0a2f998.png",
     "alt": "Map My Sheet"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Whitelisting can be done from the server side or by their admin. Click on the below button and check how to whitelist Google Workspace add-ons.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/7f49cd2470bcece1.png",
     "alt": "Cloud Flow Director"
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Read how to whitelist add-ons?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/790b1d69262fcd7d.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "h2",
     "text": "How to Configure Google Workspace Domain for Google Marketplace App Access?",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "24px",
     "color": "rgb(208, 23, 82)",
     "anchor": "how-to-configure-google-workspace-domain-for-google-marketplace-app-access"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/26194d490464fb74.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Google Workspace is a leading platform providing a comprehensive suite of communication, collaboration, and productivity tools. To fully utilize its capabilities, domain administrators must configure settings properly to access third-party applications available in the Google Workspace Marketplace.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/57a7aa5d52a85c1d.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "For organizations using Google Workspace, please ensure that your domain administrator has enabled Drive and Docs within the Google Admin dashboard. This setting can be found under Apps > Google Workspace in the dashboard.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/1ab5955f2dd574d1.png",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Additionally, the administrator should allow users to install any app from the Google Workspace Marketplace.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
     "tag": "img",
     "text": "",
     "href": "",
     "src": "/images/f1afeb0cfd3ac8d8.jpg",
     "alt": ""
    },
    {
